{"operations":[{"content":"# Core hours\n\nCore working hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026, as established by the board resolution of 15 September 2026[[cite:obs-6c430ea26b214a09bb41013dc744daa4d3520383 \"Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026.\"]].\n\nWhere the board resolution of 15 September 2026 and the staff handbook differ, the resolution applies. The staff handbook states core hours as from 10:00 to 16:00 on working days[[cite:obs-607b213d9136090947ffb07930a6e87b5856a9d8 \"Core hours are from 10:00 to 16:00 on working days.\"]].","expected_sha256":"95599f78b5502ced097bf6c3a8a462f93868e193ae36501badd312db3464f557","kind":"modify","path":"doc/hours.md"}],"rationale":"Added the core working hours from the board resolution and noted the difference with the staff handbook, specifying that the resolution applies, with exact citations for each statement."}